    <string name="whats_new_title">What\'s new in v%1$s</string>
    <string-array name="whats_new_items">
        <item>Present thread tuning: the vblank thread is now named, requests priority above the GPU thread, and paces frames in 4 ms slices instead of one long sleep — smoother frame delivery.</item>
        <item>The pipeline cache now also flushes after 250 new pipelines, so a crash during shader warm-up loses far less compiled work.</item>
        <item>New setting — Streaming buffer (64–256 MB): helps titles that fill the ring every frame (Asterix XXL2 class); per-game and global, in Settings → Performance.</item>
        <item>Updater fix: version suffixes now compare correctly (v0.0.5pro &lt; v0.0.5proplus &lt; a plain v0.0.5) — without it, this update would never have been offered to 0.0.5pro devices.</item>
        <item>Perf overlay: smoothed FPS readout (no more whole-frame jumps) and less garbage per sample.</item>
        <item>Cleanup: 374 lines of commented-out dead code removed across 26 files, including a 199-line #if 0 block — see the commit history for all 60+ changes.</item>
    </string-array>
